  "title": "Code Standards Validation - Sample",
  "description": "Ensure modules follow coding guidelines.",
  "priority": "Low"
}

### Retrieve operational request
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/requests/{{architectureRequest.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerLogin2.response.body.$.accessToken}}

